{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒里奈に会いに来てくださり本当にありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の名古屋全国握手会はジャンポリの収録の為に参加できませんでしたが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンポリも皆さんの応援のお陰で、2016年も放送出来ましたし、収録納めが出来ました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/12/18/6168032/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この4人の絆、ジャンポリスタッフさん全員含め絆が深まりましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来年もジャンプを盛り上げていくぞーー！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いしますってばよっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日の個別握手会は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/12/18/6168032/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーに水曜日のカンパネラのコムアイさんみたいねって言われたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/12/18/6168032/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/12/18/6168032/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうかしら？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/12/18/6168032/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/12/18/6168032/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/12/18/6168032/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕祭をして頂きました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も生誕委員の皆様ありがとうございます(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メッセージゆっくり読みます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"プレゼントも受け取りましたありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/12/18/6168032/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あやねちゃんにお手紙読んでもらいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/12/18/6168032/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋田出身アイドルの伝説作ろうね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あやねちゃんの武道館でのパフォーマンスが覚醒していた！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も頑張らなきゃ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、ざっくりだけど、秋田と何かコラボしたいなぁ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全然違うけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昔秋田わか杉国体でテーマソングのダンスあったのよね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当時の小学生始めいろんな人が踊ったダンス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せっかくアイドルだから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういう風に秋田をPRするものに携わりたいなぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、語ってみる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生の覚醒者が沢山いた！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勿体無いぞ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よき方向に舵をきるのだ乃木坂さん！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生誕祭で言った言葉が来年やりたい事です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、来年も私を是非応援してください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらく会えないけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テレビ出たり、収録したりしてるので生駒ちゃんもがんばってるから私も俺も頑張ろうって思ってくれたらいいなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/12/18/6168032/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}